emitTest at modelXDone do emit
emitTest at modelXDone branch ifError emit goto refused else goto emitDone
emitTest at emitDone do readC
emitTest at emitDone branch ifError readC goto refused else goto readCDone
emitTest at readCDone do findMainWrapper
emitTest at readCDone branch ifError findMainWrapper goto refused else goto findMainWrapperDone
emitTest at findMainWrapperDone do findSignature
emitTest at findMainWrapperDone branch ifError findSignature goto refused else goto findSignatureDone
emitTest at findSignatureDone do findConstantText
emitTest at findSignatureDone branch ifError findConstantText goto refused else goto findConstantTextDone
emitTest at findConstantTextDone do findConstantRead
emitTest at findConstantTextDone branch ifError findConstantRead goto refused else goto findConstantReadDone
emitTest at findConstantReadDone do findPassText
emitTest at findConstantReadDone branch ifError findPassText goto refused else goto findPassTextDone
