emitTest at findPassTextDone branch ifError findResetText goto refused else goto findResetTextDone
emitTest at findResetTextDone do findCallText
emitTest at findResetTextDone branch ifError findCallText goto refused else goto findCallTextDone
emitTest at findCallTextDone do findReturnText
emitTest at findCallTextDone branch ifError findReturnText goto refused else goto findReturnTextDone
emitTest at findReturnTextDone do lexY
emitTest at findReturnTextDone branch ifError lexY goto refused else goto lexYDone
emitTest at lexYDone do newWordsY
emitTest at lexYDone do newRowsY
emitTest at lexYDone do groupY
emitTest at lexYDone branch ifError groupY goto refused else goto groupYDone
emitTest at groupYDone do newEntitiesY
emitTest at groupYDone do newNamesY
emitTest at groupYDone do modelY
emitTest at groupYDone branch ifError modelY goto refused else goto modelYDone
emitTest at modelYDone do newBadC
emitTest at modelYDone do emitBad
emitTest at modelYDone branch ifError emitBad goto badRefused else goto refused
emitTest at badRefused do describeBad
emitTest at badRefused do expectBad
emitTest at badRefused do newOtherC
emitTest at badRefused do emitOther
emitTest at badRefused branch ifError emitOther goto otherRefused else goto refused
emitTest at otherRefused do describeOther
emitTest at otherRefused do expectOther
emitTest at otherRefused return ok none
emitTest at refused do failRefused
emitTest at refused return ok none

store is region
store in emitTest
store strategy arena
store maxBytes 16777216
store released atReturn

